{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"東區走廊電單車撞欄　司機受傷送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-SKW-261118-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】東區走廊有電單車失事撞欄，司機受傷送院。</p><p>電單車車身斷開兩截，碎片散落地上。警方中午1時許接報，該電單車沿東區走廊往中環方向行駛，駛到近筲箕灣出口時，懷疑失控撞向路中防撞欄。電單車司機墮地受傷，由救護車送東區醫院治理。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:03:57.242004+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:31:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T21:24:55.058917+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:57:29.590063+00:00","content_hash":"c2a187e30c0980be2b6c6d08143fafe2bc6babecb28c4e0ed83b19e9b0551d04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:03:57.242004+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}